+# Wire Format
+
+The project's current recorded decision is to use CBOR (Concise Binary Object Representation, RFC 7049) as the wire serialisation format. It was chosen for its stronger standardisation and for having fewer version-compatibility issues, which favours long-term maintainability and interoperability.
